edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186399691 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "f8efb9aa-532e-55ae-9077-3bedc400e006" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186400380 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186400381 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186400380 #edb/ref 1069 "q-129129" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186400380 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186400380 #edb/ref 1071 "What would be the system of equations for the following augmented matrix?\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}0 & 8 & 6 \\\\ 4 & 1 & -9\\end{aligned}]\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186400380 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "10f47672-b02f-5835-a498-94f2d2a69a14" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186400380 #edb/ref 1074 "The augmented matrix consists of two parts: the coefficient matrix and the column of constants.\n\nThe coefficient matrix represents the coefficients in the linear system, while the column of constants represents the constants on the right-hand sides of the equations.\n\nUsing the variables $x$ and  $y$,  the corresponding system of equations is\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}0x+8y=6 \\\\ 4x+y=-9.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nBy simplifying, we obtain\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}8y=6 \\\\ 4x+y=-9.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186400381 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186400382 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186400381 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186400383 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186400381 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186400384 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186400381 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186400385 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186400381 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186400386 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186400381 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186400381 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186400381 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186400386 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186400381 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "1f8ada74-f43b-5b8f-a0b1-562915c30921" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186400382 #edb/ref 1080 "{\\begin{aligned}8x+y=6 \\\\ 4x+y=-9\\end{