+0y=-1\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSimplifying both equations in the system, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}5y=9 \\\\ x=-1.\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186400486 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186400487 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186400486 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186400488 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186400486 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186400489 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186400486 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186400490 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186400486 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186400491 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186400486 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186400486 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186400486 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186400487 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186400486 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "0c4d849c-e24c-5150-9286-220ece393a3b" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186400487 #edb/ref 1080 "\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}5y=9 \\\\ x=-1\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186400487 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186400487 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "3cfc179d-5b69-5b59-a4e1-203c8dd4bb22" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186400488 #edb/ref 1080 "\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}5y=9 \\\\ x=1\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186400488 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186400488 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "9fb23989-8b95-58e0-be53-600d7e758325" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186400489 #edb/ref 1080 "\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}5y=-9 \\\\ x=-1\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186400489 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186400489 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "46e0ac2a-9f8f-5e38-9016-5ba65e5cde4e" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186400490 #edb/ref 1080 "\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}x+5y=9 \\\\ x=-1\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [175